/: Prediction Market — AMM-based price forecasting
/: Phase 1: feed → AMM fair price → solvency check → certified prediction
/: Phase 2: multi-source confidence weighting (TODO)

concept price_feed, volatility, volume, predicted_price, confidence_score
concept pool_state, solvency_flag, certified_prediction, norm

relation ingest_feed : price_feed -> volume              /: extract trade volume
relation compute_vol : price_feed -> volatility          /: historical volatility
relation amm_price : price_feed × pool_state -> predicted_price  /: AMM swapOut formula
relation confidence : predicted_price × volatility -> confidence_score  /: inverse to volatility
relation check_solvency : predicted_price × pool_state -> solvency_flag  /: reserveGuard
relation certify_pred : predicted_price × confidence_score × solvency_flag -> certified_prediction
relation self_check_norm : norm -> norm                   /: fixed-point on norm revision

/: 
Simple prediction path (open loop, no solvency check):
  price_feed → ingest_feed → volume
  price_feed → compute_vol → volatility  
  price_feed × pool_state → amm_price → predicted_price
  predicted_price × volatility → confidence → score
  open market = no guard, no certificate
:/
path: simple_prediction(price_feed, pool_state) -> predicted_price
    <- volume
    <- volatility
    <= amm_price(price_feed, pool_state)
    <= confidence(predicted_price, volatility)
    <- confidence_score
    <* self_check_norm(confidence_score)   /: ampliative: confidence alters itself

/: 
Certified prediction path (institutional closure):
  Same as above + solvency check + certificate
  KernelChoice.fairPrice → reserveGuard → closedMarket
  CortexCertificate emitted with price, cost, residue
:/
path: certified_prediction(price_feed, pool_state, norm) -> certified_prediction
    <= ingest_feed(price_feed)
    <= compute_vol(price_feed)
    <- volume
    <- volatility
    <= amm_price(price_feed, pool_state)
    <- predicted_price
    <= check_solvency(predicted_price, pool_state)
    <- solvency_flag
    <= certify_pred(predicted_price, confidence_score, solvency_flag)
    :closure:

/: 
Arbitrary norm path (decree, no AMM):
  Bypass amm_price entirely — set threshold by fiat
  KernelChoice.arbitrary → paradoxMarket
  No certificate emitted
:/
path: decree_prediction(price_feed, norm) -> norm
    <= compute_vol(price_feed)
    <- volatility
    <= self_check_norm(norm)
    :closure:
    /: paradox: arbitrary threshold produces no certified prediction

/: 
Coupling signatures:
  - AMM path: commutative-associative (rightComb canonical — pool state is symmetric)
  - Volatility path: non-commutative (time series order matters)
  - Norm path: commutative (no ordering constraints)
:/
coupling amm_path: commutative_associative (rightComb)
coupling volatility_path: non_commutative
coupling norm_path: commutative

/: 
============================================================
Phase 2 (TODO): multi-source confidence weighting
  - Multiple price_feeds → weighted average by confidence
  - Confidence = 1 / (1 + volatility)  (inverse sigmoid)
  - If confidence < threshold → open market (no prediction)
  - If all sources disagree → paradox (zero divisor)
============================================================
:/
